19147398", "text": "Ravana never wrote shiv tandav stotra. It was written in 7th century", "timestamp": 1794208089, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "balu_____777____", "author_id": "54845963135", "id": "17946806214363790", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1794199278, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "duryodhan_67", "author_id": "24079702900", "id": "17996410035058801", "text": "Ok I believe in God and all the mythological stories but I have a question, how much is this meditation for 1000 years can be true. For almost every vardaan Ravan did penace for 1000 years, if he needs anything he'll meditate for nothing less than 1000 years , so how many 1000 years that would be? And how much truth can it be?", "timestamp": 1794196685, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "gauravdubey747876", "author_id": "59420420949", "id": "18122241656055582", "text": "😮", "timestamp": 1794191139, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_aksh_v__", "author_id": "18065238765", "id": "18122957666070719", "text": "@sivaaa_____________  annaaa sccnnn", "timestamp": 1794190610, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "rao_shaaab", "author_id": "3031512738", "id": "18069352778789058", "text": "Mahesh", "timestamp": 1794190459, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "shubbzzzzz_____111", "author_id": "27971994654", "id": "17914129608559472", "text": "Shubham", "timestamp": 1794187080, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "rudransh_galaaa", "author_id": "23594022004", "id": "17916417594498744", "text": "🔥", "timestamp": 1794166799, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "theshivsaga", "author_id": "4094333386", "id": "18102530162440777", "text": "Shiv Narayan singh chauhan", "timestamp": 1794165191, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DeYuy6WxXms/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeYuy6WxXms", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/844023441_18124579585755882_2247886591350979710_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&_nc_m